  "description": "Deep in debt, Mi-Ru steps into the world of gay pornography. Without prior notice on the day of the shoot, Mi-Ru ends up filming an SM AV with Sa-Rang and receives an unimaginable experience whilst filming. Exhausted beyond belief, Mi-Ru gets home greeted with an eviction notice stuck on his door. With nowhere to turn, he seeks out Jeong-Yeol (friend with benefits) who always remains by his side but... What awaits Mi-Ru as he becomes entangled between Sa-Rang and Jeong-Yeol? \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n *Note: Chapter count includes 3 side story chapters.*",
